{"id":"n80752-1-11","stage":5,"title":"판매원 · 售货员","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80752-1-11-1","ko":"이 옷 괜찮지 않니? 그런데 색이 좀 별로다.","zh":"这件衣服不错吧？不过颜色有点一般。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"괜찮지","meaning":"不错","explanation":"괜찮다：不错；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"1","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않니?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"그런데：可是，可","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"색이","meaning":"色，色彩","explanation":"색：色，色彩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"1","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별로다.","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"不错","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"挺好。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"可是，可","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"用于将话题与前面内容相连接的同时，又将话头转向其他方向。","pronunciation":["그런데"]},{"id":"4e0f2a64814ac0cd","term":"색","zh":"色，色彩","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3","entryId":"20231","definition":"物体吸收光后表现出的明暗或红、黄、蓝等颜色。","pronunciation":["색"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]}],"audio":"/audio/d8c83d767a215679ffa4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80752-1-11-2","ko":"다른 색 옷이 있는지 판매원한테 한번 물어보자.","zh":"我们去问问店员有没有其他颜色的衣服吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"색","meaning":"色，色彩","explanation":"색：色，色彩","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"1","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"판매원한테","meaning":"售货员，营业员","explanation":"판매원：售货员，营业员；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"판매원","audio":"/audio/d6d6bf18794ed0457ca4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80752","senseId":"1","lemma":"판매원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"曾经，曾","explanation":"한번：曾经，曾","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57334","senseId":"3","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물어보자.","meaning":"掩藏，掩盖；试，试图","explanation":"묻다：掩藏，掩盖；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15722","senseId":"2","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"4e0f2a64814ac0cd","term":"색","zh":"色，色彩","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3","entryId":"20231","definition":"物体吸收光后表现出的明暗或红、黄、蓝等颜色。","pronunciation":["색"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"处于，处在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物继续保持某种状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"d6d6bf18794ed045","term":"판매원","zh":"售货员，营业员","audio":"/audio/d6d6bf18794ed0457ca4.mp3","entryId":"80752","definition":"从事出售商品工作的人。","pronunciation":["판매원"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"曾经，曾","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57334","definition":"过去经过的某个时候。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"掩藏，掩盖","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"15722","definition":"将事情深藏起来。","pronunciation":["묻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2db7bedf6ea5812709b5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.32,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80752","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这件衣服不错吧？不过颜色有点一般。","我们去问问店员有没有其他颜色的衣服吧。","你们家好像有很多稀有的物品呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这件衣服不错吧？不过颜色有点一般。","我们去问问店员有没有其他颜色的衣服吧。","你们家好像有很多稀有的物品呢。"],"answer":1}]}
